    ('水泥砂浆', 'shuǐní shājiāng', 'vữa xi măng', '工人用水泥砂浆抹平墙面。', 'Gōngrén yòng shuǐní shājiāng mǒ píng qiángmiàn.', 'Công nhân trát tường bằng vữa xi măng.', 'https://ssmqppvkgffknfqdvpwg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/card-audio/templates/xay-dung-cong-trinh-300-tu/word-ca213ac8ea274b9b081eca38.mp3', 'https://ssmqppvkgffknfqdvpwg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/card-audio/templates/xay-dung-cong-trinh-300-tu/sentence-d3e548c4cd6fd07de1542700.mp3', 37),
