    ('木材', 'mùcái', 'gỗ', '木材用于模板支撑和室内装饰。', 'Mùcái yòng yú móbǎn zhīchēng hé shìnèi zhuāngshì.', 'Gỗ dùng làm cốp pha và trang trí nội thất.', 'https://ssmqppvkgffknfqdvpwg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/card-audio/templates/xay-dung-cong-trinh-300-tu/word-30a9333b4fe5013b8dc1f253.mp3', 'https://ssmqppvkgffknfqdvpwg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/card-audio/templates/xay-dung-cong-trinh-300-tu/sentence-1df8e3453656c260ce656a91.mp3', 42),
